//! AC description: Proptest: aggregate is permutation-invariant. For any Vec<ReceiptCheck> of length 1..16, aggregate(shuffled) returns the same (pass_count, block_count, verdict) triple as aggregate(original).
//! Test predicate: tests/acceptance_ac6.rs
